WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.400
Here's what done looks like.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:04.862
The monthly run is scheduled
and runs with the change record.

3
00:00:04.862 --> 00:00:08.025
The metrics reach the
security officer each month.

4
00:00:08.025 --> 00:00:10.875
The check passes on last
month's folder this month.

5
00:00:10.875 --> 00:00:14.225
The quarter's exercise record
is named in the settings.

6
00:00:14.225 --> 00:00:16.935
And the evidence folder
is on agency storage,

7
00:00:16.935 --> 00:00:19.425
kept to the evidence catalog's retention.

8
00:00:19.425 --> 00:00:23.511
Next, Chapter 9 schedules this
run and takes the kit live,

9
00:00:23.511 --> 00:00:25.600
test first, then production.

10
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:26.760
Thanks for watching.
